HST Office Start Center: HASON TECH solutions banner, three editors, no donation UI.

- The donation banner area shows a one-line HASON TECH solutions banner on
  every start while Misc/ShowDonation is enabled (upstream: every 30 days).
  The artwork ships as the custom brand image donate1.png (2x pixels, drawn at
  half size); donation texts and the right image are hidden; the clickable link next to the
  image reads "Xem các giải pháp tại hasontech.vn →" (no fake button in the image).
- The Start Center donation button is never shown; the Extensions button keeps
  opening the extensions site.
- Banner link opens Menus/DonationURL (https://hasontech.vn, hst-defaults.patch)
  with utm_source=hst-office&utm_medium=start-center&utm_campaign=hst-office-1-0.
  The application sends no data; UTM only describes the user's click.
- "Create" buttons: only "_Text Document" / "_Spreadsheet" / "_Presentation"
  (vi: "_Văn bản" / "_Bảng tính" / "_Trình chiếu"); Draw, Math and Base buttons
  are hidden (those components stay installed for use inside the three editors).

License: modified upstream files keep their license (MPL-2.0; translations
under their upstream license). Test: Start Center screenshot under Xvfb.
